From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] metaedit: set exact committer timestamps

Add --committer-timestamp for setting the committer timestamp directly
and --timestamp as shorthand for setting both author and committer
timestamps. Avoid rewriting when the requested values already match the
commit.
---
